          "value": "<p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +6 to hit, reach 5 ft., one creature. <em>Hit:</em>21 ([[/damage 4d8 + 3 necrotic]]). The target must succeed on a DC 14 Constitution saving throw or its hit point maximum is reduced by an amount equal to the damage taken. This reduction lasts until the target finishes a long rest. The target dies if this effect reduces its hit point maximum to 0.</p>",
